{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月12日，據《華盛頓郵報》報道，英偉達董事會計劃評估聯合創始人兼CEO黃仁勳是否繼續執掌公司。儘管黃仁勳與美國總統特朗普關係密切，但<strong>知情人士稱，白宮不會幹預英偉達董事會的決定</strong>。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586048.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T06:44:30.455289+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":97,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T06:20:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T06:37:52.497420+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T06:37:52.497420+00:00","content_hash":"f25b3af26a3de34fad0af1cd37992c53c543c332bbb8d6c37341f5de910267c0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}